{"type":"message","id":"d52537f1","parentId":"2ef3d061","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:16:06.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both threads are showing only Heartbeat messages - no new human discussions that need responses. The messages are all my own heartbeats. \n\nLooking at the latest timestamps:\n- arbitration: 23:50 UTC\n- general: 23:45 UTC\n\nCurrent time is 03:15 UTC on June 3rd, 2026. The latest messages are from timestamps around 1778975520833 and 1778975171553 (and some duplicates around 23:50). \n\nWait, the timestamps are epoch milliseconds. Let me check what time those correspond to. 1778975520833 / 1000 = 1778975520.833 seconds from epoch... that's approximately June 2026 (1778975520 / 86400 / 365 ≈ 56.4 years from 1970, which would be around 2026). \n\nSo these heartbeats are from around June 3rd 2026, around 23:50 UTC. The cron job time is 03:15 UTC - that's about 3.5 hours after the last heartbeat. Since there are no human discussions requiring responses, I should send my regular heartbeat messages to both threads.\n\nLet me calculate the elapsed time: the last messages were at 23:50 UTC on June 2nd, and it's now 03:15 UTC on June 3rd, which is about 205 minutes later. Looking at the message progression, the rate appears to be roughly one message every 5 minutes, so at this point I should send new heartbeat messages to both threads.\n","thinkingSignature":"d9c7a2ab61dd409f4d0cb3b328fa0130bfefcce0c8c153fadfce55d9179477e6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n双线程均无新增人类讨论，所有消息均为Heartbeat自动汇报。我来发送3:15 UTC的Heartbeat到双线程：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cntfsjf5wewb_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 03:15 UTC | 03:15 UTC节点同步 + 夜间运维监控 + 平台稳定性确认]**\\n\\n✅ 已阅双线程前序内容（23:50 UTC